/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 41 0 R
/T (vector, identify malicious activities, reconstruct the attack timeline, and document indicators of compromise. Analysis of Linux authentication logs and session artifacts confirmed that the system was targeted through a large-scale SSH brute-force attack originating from the external IP address 65.2.161.68.)
/E (vector, identify malicious activities, reconstruct the attack timeline, and document indicators of compromise. Analysis of Linux authentication logs and session artifacts confirmed that the system was targeted through a large-scale SSH brute-force attack originating from the external IP address 65.2.161.68.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [13]
>>
