71 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 41 0 R
/T (Following numerous failed authentication attempts against administrative accounts, the attacker successfully authenticated as the root user on 06 March 2024 at 06:32:45 UTC. After gaining privileged access, the attacker established an interactive SSH session, created a persistent local backdoor account named cyberjunkie, and executed a remote shell script obtained from GitHub using the Linux utility curl.)
/E (Following numerous failed authentication attempts against administrative accounts, the attacker successfully authenticated as the root user on 06 March 2024 at 06:32:45 UTC. After gaining privileged access, the attacker established an interactive SSH session, created a persistent local backdoor account named cyberjunkie, and executed a remote shell script obtained from GitHub using the Linux utility curl.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
72 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 41 0 R
/T (The investigation reconstructed the entire intrusion by correlating text-based authentication logs with binary session history contained within the wtmp artifact. Evidence confirmed that the attacker maintained an active interactive session for 279 seconds, during which persistence mechanisms were deployed to retain future administrative access.)
/E (The investigation reconstructed the entire intrusion by correlating text-based authentication logs with binary session history contained within the wtmp artifact. Evidence confirmed that the attacker maintained an active interactive session for 279 seconds, during which persistence mechanisms were deployed to retain future administrative access.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
