/Title (Following numerous failed authentication attempts against administrative accounts, the attacker successfully authenticated as the root user on 06 March 2024 at 06:32:45 UTC. After gaining privileged access, the attacker established an interactive SSH session, created a persistent local backdoor account named cyberjunkie, and executed a remote shell script obtained from GitHub using the Linux utility curl.)
