/Title (The investigation reconstructed the entire intrusion by correlating text-based authentication logs with binary session history contained within the wtmp artifact. Evidence confirmed that the attacker maintained an active interactive session for 279 seconds, during which persistence mechanisms were deployed to retain future administrative access.)
